# Local secrets for `astro dev` / `wrangler dev`.
#
# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` and fill it in. `.dev.vars` is git-ignored —
# never commit a filled-in copy.
#
# On Cloudflare these same three names are set as Worker secrets, not as
# build-time variables. Either:
#   npx wrangler secret put RESEND_API_KEY
# or paste them into Cloudflare dashboard → Workers → chinafactoryhost →
# Settings → Variables and Secrets.
#
# RESEND_API_KEY — transactional mail API key from https://resend.com/api-keys
#                  Workers cannot open SMTP sockets, so mail goes over HTTPS.
# INQUIRY_TO     — mailbox that receives inquiries
# INQUIRY_FROM   — From address. Must be on a domain verified in Resend,
#                  otherwise Resend rejects the send with 403.
RESEND_API_KEY=
INQUIRY_TO=
INQUIRY_FROM=
